{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20230301\/20230301094004_74572.png","category_id":"6a15761c36fd3b1e17366834","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2023-03-01 09:30:20","details":"<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#666666;\"><strong>摘要<\/strong><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:#666666;\">建立了一种由基质金属蛋白酶(MMPs)触发的多功能胶束系统，负载传统化疗药物紫杉醇(PTX)和抑制基质金属蛋白酶的marimastat (MATT)，以防止肿瘤的生长和转移。该胶束是由MMPs敏感肽作为PTX和聚乙二醇(PEG)之间的桥接物合成的共轭物自组装而成。来源于小鼠乳腺肿瘤的高转移细胞株4T1作为细胞模型。细胞毒性实验和细胞凋亡分析表明，与不敏感胶束相比，敏感胶束的毒性和细胞凋亡均增加。此外，Transwell侵袭实验显示该体系在肿瘤球中表现出较高的穿透能力和显著的侵袭抑制作用。在4T1荷瘤BALB\/c小鼠中，该系统抑制了转移瘤的生长，预防了肺转移的发生，且全身毒性较低。在肿瘤转移过程中起重要作用的MMP-2和MMP-9表达下调。体内外研究结果表明，MMPs敏感胶束共递送PTX和MATT不仅具有显著的抗肿瘤作用，而且对肿瘤转移也有明显的抑制作用，而肿瘤转移是肿瘤死亡的主要原因。该功能性粒子系统为转移性乳腺癌的治疗提供了一种有前景的策略。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Powder Technology. Volume 358, 15 December 2019, Pages 3-12<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1016\/j.powtec.2018.08.045<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#666666;\">Matrix lloproteinases sensitive multifunctional micelles for inhibition of static tumor growth and stasis<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Chao Qin, Xin Yang, Yubing Wu, Yaqi Lv, Li Zhang, Xiaofei Xin, Lei Yang, Wei He, Xiaopeng Han, Lifang Yin, Chunyong Wu<\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#090909;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"color:#666666;line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:2;\"><strong>以上研究使用赛诺邦格的产品：<\/strong><\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#090909;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"color:#666666;\"><span style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">产品名称：<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">mPEG-CM<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><\/span><\/span><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#090909;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"color:#666666;\"><span style=\"line-height:2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">产品简称：<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">甲氧基聚乙二醇乙酸<\/span><\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#090909;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"color:#666666;\"><span style=\"line-height:2;\"><\/span><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#090909;font-family:\" font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"> <img src=\"data:image\/png;64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAOcAAAAkCAYAAAByiC06AAAACXBIWXMAABJ0AAASdAHeZh94AAAI8UlEQVR4nO2cTWhcxx3Af\/OkdayyIr4Uqly8a1trVzHUxT74oFClJuBc5MiFxgcbG1yUenepDY0PTShtCC5J7UMoKyk1GFxsaNqD\/HFxS2ktyEJysKgLi4RWdnZ9sVN6SIsEcizrTQ8zT+\/t27cfT\/vldeYHYt7Mzs7\/P\/833\/9ZgcFgMBgMBoPBYHjG2N9pBQwGQzn7AQlMdVqRLuMgMA+MdFgPgw+r0wo0keM6\/FdHteg+NgO7cO1nMDSVzcBXwAqwpcO6dBuO7b7SzwZDUzmCWtL+sdOKdClTKPsd6bQiBpfegLQoaolzGhjUaZeA3wJ5Hd8L3NHPwvf9FJABrgGH69RjFDgLDOt4FvgEmKjz+86S7A818tVTt2r6TwNjQLpO3brFln8Cfgq8qfNuiMV4elQiS2QLKX45WMzMANzbfmqvbVt3ABKFiZK6LsRTKQEZBNcSX0zUW9eGdaqVV8InOwsTZbbLDSWjkRVxXCBPg1DvVnBN2OJ33rKr1Su\/LTWNZExCOkiGf88ZBW6hGsSgJ\/0ksIBqSM3mPHAD1yDo5wzwaR3f34I61PgS+EuVfO2uWzfZcgZlv4NscFuQjyfPS2SZbCnk7YV4KrWRMhsljE6V8grI5OOpEtvlhpLRTSviloDMescEkIzpst9phv7+zvkrrVwW2IkayffpOMBHzRDqYQR4Wz8fA\/q1zFd12jBq9qhGTIef18jX7rp1my2vo\/ace8IKXoynR0G8DSCkeDVRmBBP7dWXJPISSolMbigZDVtuI4TRaTGWHlnPizj2pE\/2JwoTQkixbjtvZ46siJ+hO7FT9pM+2S8Qx3TZ5+5tP9Xw4OvvnM7L\/THusmsWOINaWp1pVKCP93WYBq4Cyzo+g2rIoEb9asR0WKyRr9116zZb\/luH3wkrWAp5AkAgDjlLuqEHFx+t9nEGyArEod1zk8tVimg6YXSSQr4PICE9WMhcddIHi5kZy7L3qXKU7XJDyaiAcwCWZe9zyt49N7k8WMhclcr+rNniVKN18O45nZ6eBR758s1S\/54nDM4SImivOAssopaECdwG7iemwwdV5LS7bt1oy6IOQ3dOJGMAX\/fZ\/\/